                        <p class="mt-6 font-mono text-sm text-white/40 leading-relaxed">
                            The gateway and the ledger are open source.
                            <a href="https://github.com/kydehq/gateway" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-white/60 hover:text-white underline underline-offset-4 decoration-white/20 hover:decoration-white/60 transition-colors">github.com/kydehq/gateway →</a>
                        </p>
